  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Deepening Democracy - Deep Demo</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Deepening Democracy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DDTP is a multi-donor programme to strengthen institutions and to influence the political culture in Tanzania. Four components: 1) the Tanzania Africa Peer Review Mechanism (APRM) process  2) the two electoral bodies (The National Elections Commission and Zanzibar Elections Commission). 3) civic education and advocacy for related legal reform. 4. Support to Parliament and pol. parties.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">DDTP &#xE4;r ett givarsamordnat projekt f&#xF6;r att st&#xE4;rka demokratiska institutioner och utveckla demokratisk kultur i Tanzania. Fyra kompenter ing&#xE5;r: 1. African Peer Review Mechanism. 2. St&#xF6;d till valkommissionerna NEC o ZEC. 3.st&#xF6;d till medborgarutbildning och r&#xE4;ttsreformer. 4. St&#xF6;d till parlamentet och till politiska partier.</narrative>
  </description>
